Your public body of work is held in the graph as 249 structured units: *How to Get Rich* across its 50 sections, the *Happiness* and *In the Arena* series, the *Beginning of Infinity* and David Deutsch dialogues, the series with Vitalik Buterin and Matt Ridley, *How to Angel Invest*, and your long-form conversations with Joe Rogan, Tim Ferriss, Shane Parrish, and Sadhguru. Each interlocutor is a hyperedge joining those units. Everything here that builds on your thinking is credited to you in full.

